---
import SectionBlock from "@components/SectionBlock.astro";
---

<section>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-2 md:px-3 lg:px-0">

    <SectionBlock
      titleColorMode="split-secondary-primary"
      titleLines={[
        { text: "How does Budibase" },
        { text: "Handle our data?" },
      ]}
      maxWidth="xl"
      spacing="default"
      contentClass="pt-1"
    >
      <div class="criteria">

        <div class="criterion">
          <div class="criterion__title">
            Where is data stored?
          </div>

          <div class="criterion__description">
            Connect to external SQL and NoSQL databases, or use BudibaseDB.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="criterion">
          <div class="criterion__title">
            Where does Budibase run?
          </div>

          <div class="criterion__description">
            Choose between self-hosting and Budibase Cloud based on your infrastructure requirements.
          </div>
        </div>

                <div class="criterion">
          <div class="criterion__title">
            How do I connect to external systems?
          </div>

          <div class="criterion__description">
            Budibase offers dedicated connectors for databases and REST APIs. This includes mandatory HTTPS connections,
            and data-in-transit encryption using TLS 1.3. Data is also encrypted in REST with AES256.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="criterion">
          <div class="criterion__title">
            Which AI models are used?
          </div>

          <div class="criterion__description">
            Budibase supports any AI model with an OpenAI-compatible API, including local and self-hosted models.
          </div>
        </div>

                <div class="criterion">
          <div class="criterion__title">
            What data can Budibase Agents access?
          </div>

          <div class="criterion__description">
            Agents can only access connected tools and data they have been explicitly permitted to use.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </SectionBlock>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .criteria {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.25));
  }

  .criterion {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;

    padding: 1.75rem 0;

    border-bottom: 1px solid
      var(--border-color, rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.25));
  }

  .criterion__title {
    margin: 0;

    color: var(--text-primary);

    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .criterion__description {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0;

    color: var(--text-secondary);

    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .criteria {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .criterion {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.5rem;

      padding: 1.5rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>